{
    "schema_version": "1.2",
    "name": "strava",
    "display_name": "Strava",
    "public_catalog": {
        "visibility": "public",
        "category": "analytics_product",
        "onboarding_modes": [
            "connector_pull"
        ],
        "verification": {
            "status": "blocked",
            "reason_code": "live_evidence_not_ratified",
            "follow_up": "Ratify against one known public club id once a Strava connection exists (no test account 2026-07-21)."
        }
    },
    "auth_type": "oauth2",
    "module_kind": "kpi",
    "report_profiles": [
        {
            "id": "competitor_snapshot",
            "display_name": "Club snapshot (competitors + own)",
            "metrics": [
                "member_count",
                "following_count"
            ],
            "dimensions": [
                "date",
                "club_id",
                "club_name",
                "sport_type",
                "club_city",
                "club_state",
                "club_country",
                "is_private",
                "is_verified",
                "club_url",
                "is_own_club"
            ],
            "extraction_capabilities": {
                "row_limit": null,
                "filters_supported": false,
                "realtime": false
            },
            "extraction_path": "custom_pull",
            "_api_notes": "GET /clubs/{id} per configured club id (competitor ids from per-project config + own club ids from discovery). Public clubs only; a private/absent id returns 404 and is skipped with an alert (never a fabricated zero). member_count/following_count are point-in-time snapshot LEVELS: one dated row per club (grain club_id x date)."
        },
        {
            "id": "own_club_full",
            "display_name": "Own club (snapshot; members/activities on-demand)",
            "metrics": [
                "member_count",
                "following_count"
            ],
            "dimensions": [
                "date",
                "club_id",
                "club_name",
                "sport_type",
                "club_city",
                "club_state",
                "club_country",
                "is_private",
                "is_verified",
                "club_url",
                "is_own_club"
            ],
            "extraction_capabilities": {
                "row_limit": 200,
                "filters_supported": false,
                "realtime": false
            },
            "extraction_path": "custom_pull",
            "_api_notes": "Own clubs only (discovered via GET /athlete/clubs). Persists the same club snapshot as competitor_snapshot; the membership-gated feeds (GET /clubs/{id}/members, /admins, /activities) are ANONYMIZED (first name + last initial, no athlete id, no stable PK) and are exposed as on-demand reads, cataloged as planned -- NOT persisted in v1 (privacy-lean default; decision recorded in the story)."
        }
    ],
    "canonical_metric_mapping": {
        "member_count": {
            "canonical": "member_count",
            "aggregation_rule": "latest",
            "non_additive": true
        },
        "following_count": {
            "canonical": "following_count",
            "aggregation_rule": "latest",
            "non_additive": true
        }
    },
    "canonical_dimension_mapping": {
        "id": "club_id",
        "name": "club_name",
        "city": "club_city",
        "state": "club_state",
        "country": "club_country",
        "private": "is_private",
        "verified": "is_verified",
        "url": "club_url"
    },
    "error_map": {
        "400": "invalid_request",
        "401": "auth_expired",
        "403": "permission_denied",
        "404": "permission_denied",
        "500": "provider_transient"
    },
    "_error_map_note": "VERIFIE le 2026-07-21 (https://developers.strava.com/swagger/swagger.json). Strava error body = Fault { message, errors[]:{resource, field, code} }. 'code' is a FREE-FORM string (invalid/required/exceeded/missing/not found), NOT a stable enum, so the map is keyed on HTTP STATUS ALONE (like adjust): the pure-HTTP taxonomy in core.pull_errors already lands 401->auth_expired, 403->permission_denied, 400->invalid_request, 5xx->provider_transient. 429 raises core.quota.RateLimitError (breaker path, honor Retry-After). TWO connector shims applied BEFORE classify_http_error: (a) a 403 whose Fault errors[].code=='exceeded' (or X-RateLimit-Usage at/over limit) is routed to the breaker as a rate-limit, not permission_denied (Strava historically returns 403 for rate-limit on some endpoints); (b) a 404 on the competitor_snapshot path is an EXPECTED non-fatal 'unreachable' outcome (private/absent public club) -> the club is skipped + a meta alert emitted, NEVER raised. A 404 on own_club_full (a club the athlete should belong to) stays a real permission_denied.",
    "account_topology": {
        "_comment": "Strava Clubs topology has a SINGLE level: the connected athlete's OWN clubs (GET /athlete/clubs -> SummaryClub[]). discover_accounts enumerates them. The reporting entity (selection_level) is the CLUB. Access-check = GET /clubs/{id} returns 200 for a selected own club. COMPETITOR clubs are NOT in this topology: Strava exposes no club search/list endpoint, so competitor ids are arbitrary PUBLIC ids the token can read but does not own -> they are supplied as per-project config (strava_competitor_club_ids), validated at pull time by GET /clubs/{id} (200 public / 404 unreachable). No *_CLUB_ID env var (doctrine): own selection + competitor list live in connection_ref / project config.",
        "levels": [
            {
                "id": "club",
                "label": "Club"
            }
        ],
        "selection_level": "club",
        "discovery": {
            "callable": "discover_accounts"
        }
    },
    "quota": {
        "window_seconds": 900,
        "budget_points": 100,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 1,
        "_rate_limit_note": "VERIFIE le 2026-07-21 (https://developers.strava.com/docs/rate-limits/): default 100 reads / 15 min (900s), 1000 reads/day; overall 200/15min, 2000/day. 1 club snapshot = 1 read. Conservative budget = 100 points / 900s. Backstop: 429 (and 403 'exceeded') -> RateLimitError.",
        "cost_note": "1 read per club per snapshot. own_club_full adds 1 (/athlete/clubs) + paged /members + paged /activities + 1 /admins per own club. Serialize pulls per connection."
    },
    "widget_ref": "ui://core/daily-report",
    "source_capabilities": {
        "contract_version": "1",
        "field_discovery": {
            "mode": "static",
            "allowed_targets": []
        },
        "fields": [
            {
                "field_id": "member_count",
                "source_field": "member_count",
                "kind": "metric",
                "physical_type": "integer",
                "description": "Total number of club members at the snapshot moment. Non-additive point-in-time level (aggregation_rule=latest); the growth trend is derived downstream. THE key competitive metric.",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "audience",
                    "count",
                    "non_additive"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "member_count",
                "aggregation": "latest",
                "non_additive": true
            },
            {
                "field_id": "following_count",
                "source_field": "following_count",
                "kind": "metric",
                "physical_type": "integer",
                "description": "Number of accounts the club follows, at the snapshot moment. Non-additive point-in-time level (aggregation_rule=latest).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "audience",
                    "count",
                    "non_additive"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "following_count",
                "aggregation": "latest",
                "non_additive": true
            },
            {
                "field_id": "date",
                "source_field": "date",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "date",
                "description": "Snapshot date (YYYY-MM-DD), stamped at extraction (Strava returns no date; the club object is a point-in-time snapshot). Time grain of the fact.",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "date"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "date",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "club_id",
                "source_field": "id",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Strava club unique identifier (DetailedClub.id). The snapshot grain key.",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "identifier"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "club_id",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "club_name",
                "source_field": "name",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Club display name (DetailedClub.name).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "label"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "club_name",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "sport_type",
                "source_field": "sport_type",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Club primary sport type (cycling/running/triathlon/other).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "category"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "sport_type",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "club_city",
                "source_field": "city",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Club city (free-form; not an ISO code, renamed club_* to avoid vocabulary collision).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "geography"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "club_city",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "club_state",
                "source_field": "state",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Club state/region (free-form).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "geography"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "club_state",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
                "field_id": "club_country",
                "source_field": "country",
                "kind": "dimension",
                "physical_type": "string",
                "description": "Club country (free-form, NOT an ISO-3166 code; renamed club_country to avoid colliding with the vocabulary-governed 'country' dimension).",
                "semantic_hints": [
                    "geography"
                ],
                "canonical_target": "club_country",
                "aggregation": "none",
                "non_additive": false
            },
            {
